From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:14:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ipq-wifi: add Arista C-460

Package the Arista C-460's board files: board-arista_c-460.qcn9274 for
its three QCN9224 radios, with the vendor's FCC regdb, and
board-arista_c-460.qcn9074 for its QCN9074 scan radio (qca-wireless
branch arista-c460).

Upstream this hunk belongs to the device commit. It is a port patch of
its own because the board list here already holds the Arista models
the earlier port patches add.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
---
 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile b/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile
index 9bf4a33..31fff04 100644
--- a/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile
+++ b/package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ ALLWIFIBOARDS:= \
 	arista_c-230 \
 	arista_c-260 \
 	arista_c-360 \
+	arista_c-460 \
 	arista_w-118 \
 	arista_w-318 \
 	askey_sbe1v1k \
@@ -257,6 +258,7 @@ $(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,arista_c-200,Arista C-200))
 $(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,arista_c-230,Arista C-230))
 $(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,arista_c-260,Arista C-260))
 $(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,arista_c-360,Arista C-360))
+$(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,arista_c-460,Arista C-460))
 $(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,arista_w-118,Arista W-118))
 $(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,arista_w-318,Arista W-318))
 $(eval $(call generate-ipq-wifi-package,askey_sbe1v1k,Askey SBE1V1K))
